---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import InstitutionalPage from "../components/InstitutionalPage.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Quest Luxo | Private Timepiece Advisory"
  description="Learn how Quest Luxo approaches private luxury timepiece advisory, sourcing, and client stewardship."
  canonicalPath="/about"
>
  <InstitutionalPage
    eyebrow="Company"
    title="About Quest Luxo"
    intro="Quest Luxo is an independent luxury asset advisory focused on informed decisions, discreet sourcing, and long-term client relationships."
  >
    <h2>Our role</h2>
    <p>
      We help private clients navigate luxury timepiece acquisition with
      collection intelligence, market context, and a disciplined sourcing
      process. Quest Luxo is not an authorized retailer for the manufacturers
      presented on this site.
    </p>

    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p>
      Each engagement begins with the client's objectives. We clarify the
      desired reference and configuration, review sourcing conditions, explain
      material risks, and establish transaction expectations before a client
      makes a commitment.
    </p>

    <h2>Client stewardship</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to communicate clearly, protect confidential information, avoid
      unsupported claims, and maintain records appropriate to the engagement.
      Our <a href="/transaction-standards">Transaction Standards</a> describe
      the principles that govern private sourcing.
    </p>
  </InstitutionalPage>
</BaseLayout>
